    "name": "BACKROOMS: We Escape Forever",
    "steam_appid": 3616910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616910/extras/76bc123eb2be328ae405f7a7facc8cd7.avif?t=1747229610\" data-has-big width=800 height=423 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616910/extras/5dc1fd41e87cd3def1cd859248931029.avif?t=1747229610\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We Escape Forever</strong> is a 1\u20136 player first-person co-op survival horror game, where you and your team must solve puzzles and survive mysterious, dreamlike environments to escape. <br>The rule is simple: <strong>everyone must survive for the escape to be real\u2014no one gets left behind.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616910/extras/5d7e28b0081de699cfd009902536c867.avif?t=1747229610\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Multiplayer (1\u20136 players)</strong> <br>Survive and escape together. If even one player dies, the escape fails. Teamwork is everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Ever-Expanding Dream</strong> <br>This game is continuously updated with new maps, features, and mechanics. <br>Each update adds more surreal environments to explore and survive, making the dream feel deeper and more real.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danger Lurks in Every Corner</strong> <br>Each map is inhabited by <strong>hostile beings</strong>\u2014unnatural threats that react to sight, sound, or movement. <br>You must avoid them while completing objectives. The threat is always watching, always hunting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Based Escape Gameplay</strong> <br>Escape isn\u2019t handed to you\u2014you have to earn it. Solve creative, cooperative puzzles like: <br>\u2022 Fueling a generator by collecting scattered gas cans to restore power <br>\u2022 Unlocking sealed doors by locating and playing hidden videotapes <br>\u2022 And more to come with future updates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive First-Person Experience</strong> <br>Designed for full immersion, the game uses <strong>realistic visuals, spatial audio, and atmospheric design</strong> <br>to make each run feel like you\u2019re trapped inside a lucid dream.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616910/extras/433f23206f8482770eb7e4a276a1d180.avif?t=1747229610\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a game you play once and forget. <br>It\u2019s a <strong>living world of dreams and memories</strong>, constantly evolving. <br>Every new map brings new memories. <br>And those memories? <br>They start to feel familiar\u2014like d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though you know it's just a game\u2026 <br><strong>You\u2019ll want to stay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616910/extras/39a7fcc0b5dd1398d74f18093a7ccdf1.avif?t=1747229610\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616910/extras/76bc123eb2be328ae405f7a7facc8cd7.avif?t=1747229610\" data-has-big width=800 height=423 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616910/extras/5dc1fd41e87cd3def1cd859248931029.avif?t=1747229610\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We Escape Forever</strong> is a 1\u20136 player first-person co-op survival horror game, where you and your team must solve puzzles and survive mysterious, dreamlike environments to escape. <br>The rule is simple: <strong>everyone must survive for the escape to be real\u2014no one gets left behind.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616910/extras/5d7e28b0081de699cfd009902536c867.avif?t=1747229610\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Multiplayer (1\u20136 players)</strong> <br>Survive and escape together. If even one player dies, the escape fails. Teamwork is everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Ever-Expanding Dream</strong> <br>This game is continuously updated with new maps, features, and mechanics. <br>Each update adds more surreal environments to explore and survive, making the dream feel deeper and more real.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danger Lurks in Every Corner</strong> <br>Each map is inhabited by <strong>hostile beings</strong>\u2014unnatural threats that react to sight, sound, or movement. <br>You must avoid them while completing objectives. The threat is always watching, always hunting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Based Escape Gameplay</strong> <br>Escape isn\u2019t handed to you\u2014you have to earn it. Solve creative, cooperative puzzles like: <br>\u2022 Fueling a generator by collecting scattered gas cans to restore power <br>\u2022 Unlocking sealed doors by locating and playing hidden videotapes <br>\u2022 And more to come with future updates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive First-Person Experience</strong> <br>Designed for full immersion, the game uses <strong>realistic visuals, spatial audio, and atmospheric design</strong> <br>to make each run feel like you\u2019re trapped inside a lucid dream.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616910/extras/433f23206f8482770eb7e4a276a1d180.avif?t=1747229610\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a game you play once and forget. <br>It\u2019s a <strong>living world of dreams and memories</strong>, constantly evolving. <br>Every new map brings new memories. <br>And those memories? <br>They start to feel familiar\u2014like d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though you know it's just a game\u2026 <br><strong>You\u2019ll want to stay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616910/extras/39a7fcc0b5dd1398d74f18093a7ccdf1.avif?t=1747229610\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "We Escape Forever is a co-op survival horror game for 1\u20136 players. Solve puzzles and escape dream worlds. Explore eerie environments, avoid terrifying entities, and survive together. Built with Unreal Engine 5, the game adds new levels and content regularly, offering fresh challenges.",
